scores.strengths:
A whole-state overview with no scrolling at Large: 33 cards in a 5x7 CSS grid with grid-auto-flow: column, plus flex-wrap tiles. It is simple to template:
- sc-for over cards, then over items;
- sc-if glyph flags;
- the conic-gradient pie and the box-shadow era plate as computed style strings.
Its hidden-information work is the most careful of the three:
- R128 names: 'Nanotechnology', not the combined string;
- prerequisites taken from the world-derived ruleset;
- the Milestones panel fills the spare grid cells, so no empty slot hints that a focus is missing.
The status-phrase table covers R70 for every row, and it keeps Unciv's 18-px description text. The Endeavour pill's second line fits: a 96-px bar plus '64% · about 3 turns' (139 px).
